  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 302.06 Permitting System Criteria",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 302.06 Permitting System Criteria. The following factors shall be used in the solid waste rules to determine the applicable permitting requirements:\n\n(a) The type of permit;\n\n(b) Duration of facility operations;\n\n(c) The functional classification of a facility; and\n\n(d) The quantity and type of waste handled by the facility.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300) #8462-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #10595, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14124, eff 11-23-24, EXPIRES: 11-23-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Sw 300)",
